     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">各高三学生：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 15.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">根据浙江省教育厅《关于做好“<SPAN lang=EN-US>2014</SPAN>级普通高中学生综合素质评价工作”的通知》，现将浙江省普通高中学生综合素质评价信息管理平台中高三年级学生的“品德表现”“艺术素养” “运动健康”“创新实践”等四项终评等第<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>等名单公式如下。测评结果<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>日开始公示在校园网上。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">终评等第将出现在《三位一体信息表》和《毕业生综合素质信息表》中</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">，</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>和学生的三位一体推荐、毕业、录取均有关系。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">如对评定结果</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">有异议者，请在<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>日中午<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>前向以下部门反映。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
